Once upon a time there was a bear who was friends with a bunny.
They went on many adventures through the forests together, eating berries and playing in the lake.
But one day, they encountered a scary wolf. They tried to hide from him, but the wolf still found them.
The wolf was big and had sharp teeth, but he was actually very friendly and just looking to make some friends.
The three of them threw a party and invited the whole forest -- even the snakes. 
